  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : **30 ÷ 6 × 4 + 15 - 35 = 25**\n\nSo, after interchanging two signs and two numbers :\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 25 and 30, × and -\n\n**25 ÷ 6**__ - 4 + 15 × 35 = 30\n\n4.16 - 4 + __**15 × 35**__ = 30\n\n__**4.16 + 525**__ - 4 = 30\n\n \n\n__**529.16 - 4**__ = 30\n\n525.16 ≠ 30 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : 4 and 6, + and -\n\n**30 ÷ 4**__ × 6 - 15 + 35 = 25\n\n__**7.5 × 6**__ - 15 + 35 = 25\n\n__**45 +**____** 35**__ - 15 = 25\n\n__**80 - 15**__ = 25\n\n65 ≠ 25 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : 25 and 35, × and ÷\n\n30 × **6 ÷ 4**__ + 15 - 25 = 35\n\n__**30 **____**× 1.5**__ + 15 - 25 = 35\n\n__**45 + 15**__ - 25 = 35\n\n__**60 - 25**__ = 35\n\n**35 = 35 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : 30 and 35, - and ÷\n\n35 - 6 × 4 + **15 ÷ 30**__ = 25\n\n35 - __**6 × 4**__ + 0.5 = 25\n\n__**35 + 0.5**__ - 24 = 25\n\n__**35.05 - 24**__ = 25\n\n11.05 ≠ 25 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (3)\" is the correct answer.",
